This series applies to upstream v3.2.2.0
(96377f681cc9e6650c8534671f4fc36b3c8acbc1).

Each mail-format patch preserves the complete message, author, date, and
original commit ID. Apply patches in the numbered order listed in the
component CMakeLists.txt.

The series reproduces the changes through former fork commit
6ebb3545168a3d07d61ee8f0f5e24dd8067dea10. The bext gitlink uses the
upstream release; the original brlcad branch is retained as a historical
reference.

The final patch also changed binary test-reference images. Their exact
contents are stored under reference-images, with paths listed once in
ReferenceImages.cmake. CopyReferenceImages.cmake restores them after the
text patches. No test thresholds or image contents change in this
conversion.
